0..57 Comment "//! This fixture defines an inductive-recursive universe."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..137 Comment "//! The universe follows Dybjer and Setzer. The codes and decoder share one"
138..214 Comment "//! recursive block. Induction-recursion adds nothing new to the kernel. The"
215..289 Comment "//! decoder is a function into the universe. A decode is the type that its"
290..315 Comment "//! returned code quotes."
316..319 Comment "//!"
320..399 Comment "//! A function code selects a decoded codomain. The block is one admission. The"
400..479 Comment "//! codes form with the declared type of the decoder in scope. Then the decoder"
480..558 Comment "//! is checked against the codes. A universe indexed by a level takes the same"
559..573 Comment "//! admission."
574..577 Comment "//!"
578..605 Comment "//! - see: #577 — `idNat`"
607..623 Comment "// The naturals."
